    "%lld Selected" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "已选择 %lld 张"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "%lld were already in Pictures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%lld 张已在“图片”中。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "© %@ %@. Apricot SSTV is free software: you can redistribute it and modify it under the terms of the GNU General Public License, version 3. It comes with no warranty. Its decoder began as Apricot SSTV for the iPod nano." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "© %1$@ %2$@。Apricot SSTV 是自由软件：你可以依照 GNU 通用公共许可证第 3 版的条款重新分发和修改它。本软件不提供任何担保。它的解码器源自 iPod nano 版的 Apricot SSTV。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 kHz" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12 kHz"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "12 kHz holds everything the decoder uses: about 8 MB for a Martin M1 picture. Full Rate keeps the sound as it came in, usually 48 kHz, at four times the size. A change applies the next time you start. Apple Watch has its own setting, always at 12 kHz." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "12 kHz 已包含解码器用到的全部信息，一张 Martin M1 约 8 MB。“完整采样率”按收到时的原样保存，通常为 48 kHz，体积是 4 倍。更改从下次开始接收时生效。Apple Watch 有自己的设置，始终为 12 kHz。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A missed start" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "漏掉了开头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture that came out badly can be developed again from the sound it was decoded from: its start, slant and mode put right." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "收得不好的图片，可以用解码时的声音重新冲洗：修正它的起点、斜度和模式。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A picture was sent but nothing happened." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "有人发了图片，但没有反应。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A start too short to count as a picture is kept as a fragment, with its raw audio, which may hold a picture whose start was missed. Fragments are under the menu at the top right of Pictures." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太短、算不上一张图的接收会作为片段连同原始音频保存，其中可能有一张错过了开头的图。片段在“图片”页右上角的菜单里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About 8 MB for a Martin M1 picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "一张 Martin M1 图片约 8 MB。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "About Apricot SSTV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "关于 Apricot SSTV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add a picture here with Add to Favorites in the photo menu." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在图片菜单中选“加入常用图片”即可加到这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "加入活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add to Favorites" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "添加到常用图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Photo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整照片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adjust Position and Size" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调整位置和大小"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "After you tap Start and lower your wrist:" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "轻点“开始”并放下手腕后："
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "All Pictures" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "全部图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apple Watch" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apple Watch"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apply" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "应用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV collects no data." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 不收集任何数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Apricot SSTV turns the sound of slow-scan television into pictures, and your pictures into that sound, to send through your radio. To receive, tune your radio to a frequency where SSTV is sent, and let your iPhone or Apple Watch hear it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Apricot SSTV 能把慢扫描电视的声音变成图片，也能把你的图片变成这种声音，通过电台发送出去。接收时，把电台调到有 SSTV 发送的频率，让 iPhone 或 Apple Watch 听到它。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio File" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音频文件"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Audio lost" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "丢失的音频"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "自动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Automatic suits most listening. If you know what's coming, such as PD120 from the International Space Station, choose that mode in Settings or the ⋯ menu on Receive. Other modes are then ignored, which also avoids false starts in noise." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "大多数情况下用“自动”即可。如果你知道将要收到什么，例如国际空间站的 PD120，可以在“设置”或“接收”页的 ⋯ 菜单中选择该模式。之后其他模式会被忽略，这也能避免在噪声中误触发。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Black Hole" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "黑洞"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Built In" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "预置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "By %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "作者：%@"
          }
        }
