    "Favorites keeps pictures you send often, each where you last placed it. Built In has a test card, colour bars and the Mandelbrot set. Your callsign is drawn at the top left." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "常用图片里保存你常发的图片（各自记住上次摆放的位置）。预置里有测试卡、彩条和曼德博集合。呼号会画在左上角。"
