          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pictures from your radio, through the microphone or a USB audio interface. Apple Watch can receive on its own, and its pictures come to this iPhone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通过麦克风或 USB 声卡接收电台传来的图片。Apple Watch 可以独立接收，收到的图片会传到这台 iPhone。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pictures go to the iPhone by themselves, raw audio after them. In the watch's Pictures, a phone icon marks the ones the iPhone has." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片会自动传到 iPhone，原始音频随后。手表“图片”里带手机图标的，是 iPhone 已经有的。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Pictures go to the iPhone once its Apricot SSTV app is installed and nearby." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
