    "the chosen mode" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所选模式"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The darkroom decodes a picture's raw audio again. Every change you make is decoded again from the sound." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "暗室会把图片的原始音频重新解码。你做的每一次调整，都会从声音重新解码一遍。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "the encoder failed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "编码器出错"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The file isn't a picture Apricot SSTV can read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这个文件不是 Apricot SSTV 能读取的图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The iPhone app must be installed, and the watch and iPhone near each other. Transfers wait and finish by themselves. Settings shows whether the watch app is installed." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要 iPhone 上装有 App，并且手表和 iPhone 在附近。传输会自动等待并完成。“设置”里可以看到手表 App 是否已安装。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The mode, where the first line starts, the slant and the horizontal position. The slant can be measured on the picture: two points on an edge that should be upright, or a region with upright edges. Touch and hold the picture to compare with the original." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "可以调整模式、第一行起点、斜度和左右位置。斜度可以在图片上测：在一条本该竖直的边上放两个点，或框住一块有竖直边的区域。按住图片可以和原图对比。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original picture and its raw audio are never changed. Revert to Original goes back at any time." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "原图和原始音频永远不会被改动，随时可以“复原为原图”。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture is noisy or the colors are wrong." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片噪点多或颜色不对。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture stays." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The picture's raw audio, kept when Save Raw Audio is on." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要图片的原始音频，在开启“保存原始音频”时保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The pictures stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片会保留。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The radio keys on VOX." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "电台通过 VOX 发射。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The raw audio can't be read." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法读取原始音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tuning bar" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调谐条"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The watch taps you when a picture starts, when it's saved, when the signal is lost, and when listening stops by itself." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "图片开始、保存、信号丢失以及接收自动停止时，手表都会轻触提醒你。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Their raw audio may still hold a picture." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "它们的原始音频里可能还有图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file can't be read as audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "无法把这个文件当作音频读取。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture has no raw audio." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片没有原始音频。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This picture isn't on the iPhone yet. Delete it?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这张图片还没传到 iPhone。要删除吗？"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This recording's sample rate is too low to decode SSTV." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "这段录音的采样率太低，无法解码 SSTV。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Title" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "标题"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tone" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "音调"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too few rows to count as pictures. Their raw audio may still hold one." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "行数太少、算不上图片。它们的原始音频里可能还有图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too loud: turn the radio down" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太响了：请调低电台音量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Too loud: turn the radio down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "太响了：请调低电台音量。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch and hold the picture to see it as received." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住图片可查看收到时的原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Touch and hold to see it as received." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按住可查看收到时的原样。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Transmitting needs an amateur radio license and must follow its rules, including identifying your station." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "发射需要业余无线电执照，并须遵守执照的相关规定，包括表明你的电台身份。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tuning offset" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "调谐偏移"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Two Points" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "两点测量"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Undo" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "撤销"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Unknown" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未知"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Until you tap Stop, or no picture comes for the receive timeout." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "直到你轻点“停止”，或者超过接收超时还没有收到图片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Untitled Event" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "未命名活动"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Use" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Uses the least space." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "占用空间最少。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Usually it's the level: too low lets noise in, too high (Clipping) distorts the tones. A cable or USB interface is much cleaner than a microphone held to a speaker." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "通常是电平问题：太低会混入噪声，太高（削波）会让音调失真。用连接线或 USB 声卡，比把麦克风对着扬声器干净得多。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Valley of Fear" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "恐惧谷"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Version %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "版本 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Vertical Position" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "上下位置"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "VIS header" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "VIS 头"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for %@" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待 %@"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for a picture" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待图片"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Waiting for VIS" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "等待 VIS"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Watch app not installed" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "手表 App 未安装"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Website" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "网站"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "What it needs" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "需要什么"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When the screen dims or you leave the app, listening stops, after the picture coming in. Saves the most battery." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "屏幕变暗或离开 App 时停止接收；如果正在收图，等这张收完再停。最省电。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When they were received is worked out from the file's date." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "接收时间根据文件日期推算。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Whether listening carries on with the wrist down is under Wrist Down in the watch's own Settings. A picture coming in is always finished first." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "放下手腕后是否继续接收，在手表自己的设置的“放下手腕后”里。正在收的图总会先收完。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While an event is current, new pictures from the iPhone and Apple Watch go into it, until the end of its last day. In an event, a gap of more than 20 minutes starts a new group." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动设为当前时，iPhone 和 Apple Watch 收到的新图片都会归入它，直到最后一天结束。活动里间隔超过 20 分钟就另起一组。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While an event is current, new pictures go into it by themselves." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "活动设为当前时，新图片会自动归入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "While current, new pictures from here and Apple Watch go into it, until the end of its last day." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "设为当前时，这里和 Apple Watch 收到的新图片都会归入它，直到最后一天结束。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With a new setup, tap the share button to make a WAV and decode it with another SSTV program, or play it to Apricot SSTV on Apple Watch." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "使用新设置时，先轻点分享按钮生成 WAV，用其他 SSTV 程序解码检查，或者放给 Apple Watch 上的 Apricot SSTV 接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Save Raw Audio on, each picture keeps its sound, with as long again before and after it as it takes to send, in case its start or end was misjudged. Tapping Stop ends the recording there." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "开启“保存原始音频”时，每张图片会保留它的声音，前后各多留一段与该图发送时长相同的余量，以防开头或结尾判断错。轻点“停止”会在当时结束录音。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "With Start Without VIS on, a picture whose header was missed still starts after a few lines, from its line syncs." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "打开“无 VIS 也开始”后，即使漏掉了 VIS 头，也会在几行之后根据行同步开始接收。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
